1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 5=

12
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,519
Mr. Zhong,

13
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,200
the deadline isn't mine to set.

14
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,920
If the King holds us responsible,

15
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,719
neither of us can bear the consequences.

16
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,560
Yes. Yes.

17
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:32,719
That...

18
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,079
What's wrong?

19
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,159
Since you like it, young man,

20
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,519
just take it.

21
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,239
No, thanks.

22
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,120
Thank you.

23
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,159
It's fine.

24
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:56,920
Take it.

25
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,000
- Just take it.
- You...

26
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:00,879
No.

27
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,480
Still, thank you.

28
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,359
What are you afraid of?

29
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,120
Afraid?

30
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,120
What do I have to be afraid of?

31
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,400
Anyway, stay away from his shop.

32
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,639
And don't touch his things.

33
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,000
So you feel something's off too?

34
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:20,159
Mr. Zhong is an odd man.

35
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,400
You'd better not be too curious,
Miss Chu Li.

36
00:02:39,097 --> 00:02:42,277
(The Next Day)

37
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:54,800
(I)

38
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,319
(swapped back again?)

39
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:58,520
(Why is Chu Li here?)

40
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:05,840
Chu Li.

41
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,439
Diviner Song, what a coincidence.

42
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,280
What are you doing here?

43
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:13,080
You're overstepping, Diviner Song.

44
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:15,080
I was curious, so I came to take a look.

45
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,000
Is that not allowed?

46
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:16,800
No.

47
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,319
Why not?

48
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,840
Even if Zhong Jiang is odd,

49
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,120
he's still just an ordinary craftsman.

50
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,840
What exactly do you know?

51
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:26,159
You...

52
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,879
He's not as ordinary as you think.

53
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,879
From now on,
you're not allowed near here either.

54
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,400
That's Zhong Jiang's daughter's
residence.

55
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,680
You're in a man's body now.

56
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,319
How can you go in?

57
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,759
There are plenty of strange things
in this world.

58
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:47,879
Do you have to get involved

59
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,039
in every single one of them?

60
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:50,319
Of course I have to get involved.

61
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,800
That counts as merit.

62
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,599
You...

63
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,000
(Still trying to control me?)

64
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,400
(Once I find the Myriad Souls Lamp)

65
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,439
(and swap back,)

66
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,840
(let's see if you can control me then.)

67
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:09,400
(Those geezers)

68
00:04:09,759 --> 00:04:11,199
(finally swapped me back again.)

69
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:20,759
Why isn't Xiuxiu back yet?

70
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,399
Haven't you seen it either?

71
00:04:29,236 --> 00:04:32,143
(36 Days Before the City Falls)

72
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,519
(Xiuxiu's been gone a day.)

73
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,879
(Why isn't it back yet?)

74
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:43,319
This is not a good sign.

75
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,800
It's so late.

76
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,560
Miss Chu Li, where are you going?

77
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,160
None of your business.

78
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,759
I'll be back before dawn.

79
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,600
Right now, our lives

80
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,879
are bound together.

81
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:59,040
You'd better be careful, miss.

82
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:02,800
Even if I really have a death wish,

83
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:04,759
can you stop me?

84
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,399
Xiuxiu.

85
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:16,959
Xiuxiu!

86
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,800
Xiuxiu...

87
00:05:22,110 --> 00:05:23,803
(Zhong Wan)

88
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:25,319
What are you doing?

89
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,160
You are

90
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,439
Mr. Zhong's daughter?

91
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,839
You know my father?

92
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,040
Did

93
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,199
my father

94
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:38,480
send you to play with me?

95
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,639
It's late now.

96
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,720
I'll come play with you tomorrow.

97
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,079
Don't go.

98
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,279
Play with me.

99
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,720
Miss,

100
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,160
your face is so beautiful.

101
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,319
Give it to me, won't you?

102
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,120
Xiuxiu, don't worry about me.

103
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:04,959
Run!

104
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,480
Why are you leaving?

105
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,879
I haven't had enough fun yet.

106
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,199
What exactly are you?

107
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,680
Me?

108
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,079
I'm my father's daughter.

109
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:24,120
Play with me.

110
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:25,879
If you keep this up,

111
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,560
I'll die.

112
00:06:28,519 --> 00:06:29,279
If I die,

113
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,240
no one will play with you.

114
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,639
It's okay.

115
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,600
Father will bring you back to life.

116
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:37,519
Don't be afraid.

117
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:48,600
You...

118
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,639
You're both bullying me!

119
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,319
I'm telling my father.

120
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,000
Thank you for saving my life.

121
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,680
Who are you?

122
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,000
How did you know she's afraid of fire?

123
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:07,920
And what was that thing?

124
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,079
You...

125
00:07:25,843 --> 00:07:29,636
(Song Residence)

126
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:39,079
What are you doing?

127
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:39,720
I...

128
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,399
Didn't you say your back ached

129
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:43,639
and ask me to give you gua sha?

130
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:46,120
Don't use so much force!

131
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,199
It hurts so much!

132
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,319
You told me to use more force.

133
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,240
Master,

134
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,600
you've got a lot of internal dampness.

135
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,319
Get out.

136
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,480
(What a coincidence.)

137
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,480
(That person last night)

138
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,839
(really looked like Song Ziyuan.)

139
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,279
Why did you change clothes
without my permission?

140
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,879
I'd like to ask you something, miss.

141
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,480
This morning,

142
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:31,120
I woke up in your body

143
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,360
and found

144
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,200
myself lying in an alley.

145
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,480
Where did you go last night, miss?

146
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,159
And your clothes

147
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,600
were in such a state.

148
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,399
Last night,

149
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,200
you didn't go out?

150
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:46,039
Last night?

151
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:47,960
Where should I have gone?

152
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:54,919
Let me ask you something.

153
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,799
Why did you let Shiqi

154
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,279
leave you covered in bruises?

155
00:08:59,120 --> 00:08:59,799
I...

156
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:02,279
have excessive internal dampness.

157
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:03,440
You...

158
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,240
We swapped back.

159
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,600
I have important things to do.

160
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,240
I have to leave.

161
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:12,919
Excuse me.

162
00:09:19,109 --> 00:09:25,689
(Vessel Shop)

163
00:09:25,703 --> 00:09:31,015
(Vessel Shop)

164
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:46,919
Miss,

165
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,320
what would you like to buy?

166
00:09:49,759 --> 00:09:51,120
Just looking.

167
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,919
(Good thing
I wore men's clothes yesterday.)

168
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,639
(He didn't recognize me.)

169
00:09:55,639 --> 00:09:56,600
Mr. Zhong,

170
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,840
is Wan feeling better?

171
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,840
Look,

172
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:01,440
someone gave me some rouge.

173
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:02,200
I don't need it.

174
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,320
Give it to Wan.

175
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,919
She's not better yet.

176
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:06,240
Just leave it here.

177
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:08,120
She's still not better after so long?

178
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:09,320
This won't do.

179
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,480
I have to go see her.

180
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,320
Ma'am,

181
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,200
you're here.

182
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,399
Your father said you were ill.

183
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:18,519
(This girl was so terrifying
last night.)

184
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,879
(How come she's normal today?)

185
00:10:21,679 --> 00:10:22,960
This is some rouge someone gave me.

186
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,679
(Could someone have used)

187
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:25,000
(shamanic arts on her?)

188
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,039
Thank you, ma'am.

189
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:33,440
Miss, are you looking to buy something?

190
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,639
Just looking for now.

191
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,799
Then I'll let you get back to work.

192
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,240
I'll come see you another day.

193
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:40,879
Okay.

194
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,080
Take care, ma'am.

195
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:42,879
Okay.

196
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:50,000
See anything you like, miss?

197
00:10:50,519 --> 00:10:51,320
Everything's negotiable.

198
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,279
Help me.

199
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,519
I don't need anything today.

200
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:09,919
I'll come again another day.

201
00:11:28,817 --> 00:11:35,567
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

202
00:11:35,977 --> 00:11:42,647
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

203
00:11:43,017 --> 00:11:46,337
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

204
00:11:46,507 --> 00:11:49,707
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

205
00:11:50,037 --> 00:11:56,697
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

206
00:11:57,117 --> 00:12:03,777
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

207
00:12:04,067 --> 00:12:10,427
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

208
00:12:10,597 --> 00:12:14,027
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

209
00:12:14,287 --> 00:12:17,507
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

210
00:12:17,547 --> 00:12:24,427
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

211
00:12:24,777 --> 00:12:28,307
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

212
00:12:28,467 --> 00:12:32,027
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

213
00:12:32,427 --> 00:12:38,867
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

214
00:13:07,777 --> 00:13:14,447
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

215
00:13:14,697 --> 00:13:20,987
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
